      488.72,
      437.8
    ],
    "text": "WAGES BOARD FOR THE COIR MATTRESS AND BRISTLE FIBRE EXPORT TRADE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      450.73,
      539.94,
      497.8
    ],
    "text": "IN accordance with the provisions of Section 28 of the Wages Boards Ordinance (Chapter 136) the Wages Board for the CoirMattress and Bristle Fibre Export Trade hereby notifies that the Board, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 30 ofthe aforesaid Ordinance, proposes to vary in the manner set out in the Schedule hereto, such decisions of the Board as arespecified in that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      504.73,
      453.58,
      515.8
    ],
    "text": "Objections to the aforesaid proposal will be received by me until 12.00 noon on 15th April, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      528.73,
      539.91,
      551.8
    ],
    "text": "Every such objection should be made in writing and should contain a statement of the grounds upon which suchobjection is made.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
